hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"197","On the authority of Muhammad ibn al-Walid, on the authority of Muhammad, meaning Ibn Jafar, on the authority of Shu’bah, on the authority of Husayn, on the authority of Mujahid, on the authority of Abdullah ibn Amr, on the authority of the Prophet May God’s prayers and peace be upon him, he said: “Whoever turns away from my Sunnah is not of me.”"
